# Machine stand-ins: reasons whose every basis is a machine check (guard, assigned, returns, stdlib
# rows, literal, call-sites, boundary).  Polish would derive these itself; written out here so the
# checker can show each one's status, falsifier and payoff on the real hubs before polish learns to.
# Tier: a fact resting only on A0 (no outside rebinding) is loadable at every tier; one resting on
# A1 (project callers are all callers: call-sites, boundary, contract) only at tier I and above.

